<%- include('head') %><div class="pagehead"><div><div class="eyebrow">PREFERENCES</div><h1>Pengaturan Studio</h1><p>Logo asli MWG, tampilan watermark, dan password admin.</p></div></div><div class="settings"><section class="panel"><h2>Logo MWG asli</h2><p><%= hasLogo?'Logo sudah tersimpan. Upload untuk menggantinya.':'Belum ada logo. Upload file logo MWG asli sebelum memulai render.' %></p><form method="post" action="/settings/logo" enctype="multipart/form-data"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label>Upload PNG/JPEG (maksimum 10 MB)<input required name="logo" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg"></label><button class="primary">Simpan Logo</button></form></section><section class="panel"><h2>Watermark</h2><p>Setelan ini dipakai oleh job berikutnya saat mulai diproses.</p><form method="post" action="/settings/preset"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label>Ukuran logo (% lebar video)<input type="number" min="6" max="28" name="size" value="<%= preset.size %>"></label><label>Transparansi (0.1 – 1)<input type="number" min="0.1" max="1" step="0.05" name="opacity" value="<%= preset.opacity %>"></label><label>Posisi<select name="position"><% for(const v of ['top-left','top-right','bottom-left','bottom-right']){ %><option value="<%= v %>" <%= preset.position===v?'selected':'' %>><%= v %></option><% } %></select></label><button class="primary">Simpan Watermark</button></form></section><section class="panel"><h2>Ganti Password</h2><form method="post" action="/settings/password"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label>Password sekarang<input type="password" required name="current"></label><label>Password baru (minimal 12 karakter)<input type="password" required minlength="12" name="password"></label><button>Perbarui Password</button></form></section></div><%- include('foot') %>
